Z||000027||87ECO5||06-16-2000||02:11 PM||||Hey, Mike.  If you can get down to my place by 12:30, we can hook up with the big C.O.F.E. caravan as they come down I-71 (out by that place where we had the cookout).<P>And, no, smarty-pants Drew     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   , I won't be trailering it down.  I was only going to do that because Lisa hates driving two cars (and we were going to bring the kids).  I suggested hauling my car behind the Pathfinder so I could ride with them.  Since they're not going now, it's no longer an issue.<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 06-16-2000).]||||reg||1
