Z||000029||tgowens||06-16-2000||07:55 PM||||this is all the info I was able to get about the show -- just got an email from Gloria at FOCOA.........."When you register for the Festival it is to pay<BR>for entering your car into the car show which is on Saturday.  The banquet<BR>is on Sat night and that is where the car show awards are given out.<P>Thursday is registration and classification of your car.  Thurs night I<BR>think there is going to be a local cruise.  Friday at 12:00 we all go onto<BR>the riverboat for a cruise down/up the river (we'll have discount coupons at<BR>registration) and Friday night will be the hospitality room with Fiero hot<BR>wheel races etc.<P>We would love to have you join us.  Registration is $45.00 which includes<BR>goodie bag, dash plack and t-shirt.  Banquet is $25.00 per person and you<BR>have to make your own reservations at the hotel.  Riverside Ramada Inn 800<BR>537-3612 or 812-283-3686  you have to mention 262Y to get the special rate<BR>of $60.00.  If you plan on going we need to know so you will not be charged<BR>a late fee." -- (the final date for FOCOA reservations is July 1st..........)<P>||||reg||14
